{"type":"standard","title":"Ryan Mackenzie","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ryan Mackenzie</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q7384273","titles":{"canonical":"Ryan_Mackenzie","normalized":"Ryan Mackenzie","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ryan Mackenzie</span></span>"},"pageid":37715613,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Rep._Ryan_Mackenzie_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Ryan_Mackenzie_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/Rep._Ryan_Mackenzie_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1638,"height":2048},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375058567","tid":"76c738dd-b121-11f1-aecf-e46c7ae17aab","timestamp":"2026-09-15T16:21:11Z","description":"American politician (born 1982)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryan_Mackenzie","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryan_Mackenzie?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryan_Mackenzie?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ryan_Mackenzie"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryan_Mackenzie","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Ryan_Mackenzie","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryan_Mackenzie?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ryan_Mackenzie"}},"extract":"Ryan Edward Mackenzie is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative from Pennsylvania's 7th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he served in the Pennsylvania House of Representatives from 2012 to 2024. Before redistricting, he represented the 134th district until his final term, when he was moved to the 187th district.","extract_html":"<p><b>Ryan Edward Mackenzie</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative from Pennsylvania's 7th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he served in the Pennsylvania House of Representatives from 2012 to 2024. Before redistricting, he represented the 134th district until his final term, when he was moved to the 187th district.</p>"}